sequenceDiagram
 participant U as User
 participant H as AI Host
 participant C as MCP Client
 participant S as MCP Server
 participant G as Domain Tool Gateway
 U->>H: Request task
 H->>C: Start managed session
 C->>S: initialize(protocolVersion, capabilities, clientInfo)
 S-->>C: negotiated version + serverInfo + capabilities
 C->>S: notifications/initialized
 C->>S: tools/list
 S-->>C: tool definitions + input schemas
 H->>H: Check user consent + identity + tenant policy
 H->>C: Authorized tools/call
 C->>S: tools/call(name, arguments)
 S->>G: Validate schema + invoke scoped domain handler
 G-->>S: Result
 S-->>C: JSON-RPC result or error
 C-->>H: Untrusted tool content
 H->>C: shutdown
 C->>S: shutdown / close transport
